<title>JAPAN: Tokyo Gas shares powered by strong yen.</title>
<headline>Tokyo Gas shares powered by strong yen.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Tokyo Gas Co Ltd were higher on Wednesday afternoon, powered by the recent strength in the yen against the dollar which helps to cut procurement costs, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0452 GMT, the shares were eight yen higher at 316. Tokyo Gas was the most heavily traded issue on the Tokyo bourse at 11.20 million shares, brokers said.</p>
